From: jrosha <114847463+JRoshangah@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 13:33:56 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] Fix settings jump bar overflow, uneven action buttons and
 stray panels

- Settings section buttons pick a column count that fits the window and
  balance the rows, so no button is cut off.
- OK / Cancel pills in the action plate are equal width and shrink their
  label to fit before truncating ("Alpha Strike" in combat).
- Board-first layout: zones always open as floating windows instead of
  docking as tabs into the hand panel, floating zones can't be docked,
  and only the designed six-panel layout is saved. A saved layout with
  multiplayer splits or docked zones is discarded when a match starts.
